  "rawText": "Deluxe tomatillo\n1 lb. tomatillos\n2 full stalks green onions\n1/2 lime\n2 serranos\n3 cloves garlic\nHandful chopped cilantro\n1 tsp. salt\n1.5 tsp. sugar\n1.5 tsp. black pepper\nDash of cumin\nLittle over 1/2 cup sour cream\n1 tbsp. flour dissolved in 2 tbsp. vegetable broth (or water)\nSplash of whole milk\n\nFor enchiladas or tacos",
